# Database

- Read `.cursor/rules.md` before changing matching files.
- Keep Drizzle schema and database bootstrap code under `src/db`.
- Access persistence through domain repositories; do not query from UI components.
- Keep transactions explicit for multi-write invariants.
- Generate migrations with `npm run db:generate`; never hand-edit generated migrations.
- Run migrations separately from application startup.
- Use parameterized Drizzle/postgres APIs and never interpolate SQL input.
- Validate untrusted values with Zod before persistence.
- Keep `DATABASE_URL` and connection details in server-only modules.
